time it imports an unmodified checkout of Infini-AI-Lab/MonarchRT (Apache
License 2.0) that the administrator installs separately, and the runtime
loads Wan-AI/Wan2.1-T2V-1.3B and gdhe17/Self-Forcing weights (both published
under Apache License 2.0) downloaded by the administrator. See
docs/LICENSING.md.
